/-!
# A284189

Square array T(n,k) read by upward antidiagonals: each term is the least positive integer not yet appearing in the array that is coprime to all the terms in its associated row, column, diagonal and antidiagonal.

The 66 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

